# Compiled binaries
/bin/
/cmd/ingestd/ingestd
/cmd/replay/replay
/cmd/loadgen/loadgen

# Recorded frame files and capture data
*.zst
/data/

# Profile artefacts
*.pprof
*.prof
*.pb.gz

# Benchmark and benchstat output
*.bench
benchstat*.txt

# The M4 baseline artefacts are committed on purpose, against the three rules
# above. A measurement nobody else can rerun is not evidence, and the
# recording cannot be reconstructed: recapturing gives different ids, prices
# and frame counts (D40). Nothing else in the tree is exempt.
!docs/baseline/*.zst
!docs/baseline/*.pprof

